some graduate/post-graduate degree?

NOTE: 
- Something about mediators was mentioned in class.
- Adherence is important to look into. The investigator believes that adherence
might have a role in the effects of HART. Thinking this is the mediator we have 
to account for. Because the effects of HART will depend on whether patients were
adherent at taking HART. 

